<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Cardima started by Dain.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cardima started by Dain.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth medical technology analyst Sanjiv Arora said he started coverage of Cardima Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>Shares in the medical device manufacturer, which went public last month, were up 3/8 at 6-1/4.</p>
<p>The company makes microcatheter systems for treating heartbeat disorders.</p>
<p>&quot;Cardima has made significant progress demonstrating the clinical utility of its Pathfinder and Tracer products for both mapping and ablation,&quot; Arora said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
